('019f285d-6f00-7376-8f23-2eafd366de86','019c8f39-679e-70d2-af92-ac72a25b0d9c','service','RapidSSL Wildcard','WHMCS-P98','RapidSSL® Wildcard Certificates help you secure multiple subdomains with one low-cost SSL certificate issued to *.yourdomain.com. Protect your customers\' personal data with up to 256-bit encryption. Automated domain control validation makes site authentication a breeze. At RapidSSL, we believe in providing the SSL protection you need at a competitive price.',149.00,0.00,NULL,'marketconnect','yearly',0,'2026-07-03 11:23:59','2026-07-31 10:26:06',NULL,98,'none',NULL,NULL,0,0),
